    {
      "bbox": [
        226,
        871,
        1869,
        1236
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Government must be constantly responsive to the needs of its citizens. This Administration has always been receptive to suggestions and recommendations to improve municipal services. We must continue to seek more effective methods to make widely known the municipal services available and what the City Administration is doing to meet the problems created by the complexities of City living.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.3762,
          "min": -1.7858
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 62,
          "mean": -0.0086,
          "min": -0.5232
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7736,
        "area_px": 578759,
        "density": 0.01337,
        "chars": 391,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 50.54
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        230,
        1260,
        1832,
        1471
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In furtherance of these ends, I hereby establish at City Hall the \"Mayor's Information Center\" and a subsidiary Mobile Unit which will bring City Hall to the various neighborhoods of the City.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3541,
          "min": -1.6782
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 38,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0072
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3070,
        "area_px": 335901,
        "density": 0.00914,
        "chars": 192,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 62.54
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        371,
        1506,
        790,
        1548
      ],
      "category": "Section-header",
      "text": "The purposes will be:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.3445,
          "min": -1.5953
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.1746,
          "min": -0.3487
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 5,
          "mean": -0.002,
          "min": -0.0094
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 273,
        "area_px": 18060,
        "density": 0.01512,
        "chars": 21,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 76.92
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        431,
        1577,
        1733,
        1705
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "1) To make more accessible information on the scope and nature of municipal services, how and where to obtain them.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.3277,
          "min": -1.7928
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 23,
          "mean": -0.029,
          "min": -0.6328
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2257,
        "area_px": 168216,
        "density": 0.01342,
        "chars": 115,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 50.95
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        431,
        1730,
        1747,
        1940
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "2) To provide citizens direct channels to present to the Mayor specific complaints about municipal services, and procedures for prompt corrective action, if such action appears warranted.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2572,
          "min": -1.4116
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 31,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0007
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4229,
        "area_px": 278098,
        "density": 0.01521,
        "chars": 187,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 44.22
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        431,
        1969,
        1733,
        2174
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "3) To enable the Mayor to maintain continually on a regular basis contact with a broad base of citizens in order that government may be continually responsive to their needs.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2518,
          "min": -1.5688
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 2,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 32,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0003
        }
      },
